# The organizers' course files must stay byte-identical to the download: their sha256 is recorded in
# maps/course/SOURCE.md and in the built map's metadata. No line-ending conversion on any platform.
maps/course/** -text
courses/*/course/** -text
*.npz binary
# Shell scripts run on Linux (the drone, the T4): LF endings everywhere, or bash chokes on the carriage returns.
*.sh text eol=lf
